 ║  <ansi fg="cyan-bold">.:  M E S S A G E   O F   T H E   D A Y</ansi>                                    ║
 ╠═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
 ║ TALK TO PEOPLE. Type talk <name> for a numbered menu of what someone knows  ║
 ║ and what they need. A [!] before a name means they have work for you.       ║
 ║ EVERY STEP HAS A HINT. Your quest log says what to do next, and the map     ║
 ║ points the way.                                                             ║
 ║ LOOK AND SEARCH. Type look <thing> to study anything you see, and type      ║
 ║ search to find what is hidden. Many secrets give way to one or the other,   ║
 ║ so bring a light.                                                           ║
 ║ LISTEN TO THE GOSSIPS. Some of what they repeat is worth chasing.           ║
 ║ The novel: https://dogmud.org/novel                                         ║
 ║ Full patch notes: https://dogmud.org/patch-notes                            ║
 ╚═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝</ansi>
